{"title":"The Bully In-Charge","synopsis":"Setelah putus sekolah Kwon Daegun sedang mempersiapkan ujian kualifikasinya Saat dia sedang bekerja paruh waktu di sebuah toko serba ada dia berkelahi dengan beberapa preman Daegun yang dengan mudah mengalahkan mereka ditawari sebuah proyek yang disebut Iljin in ChargeThe Bully In Charge oleh Yayasan Pendidikan yang telah mengawasinya sejak lama Dia yang menerima tawaran itu setelah banyak pertimbangan memasuki sekolah menengah milik yayasan dan mengalahkan para pembully di sekolah ini satu per satu sesuai dengan perintah yayasan","alternative_title":"일진담당일진, Designated Bully","author":"GRIMZO","artist":"GRIMZO","genres":["Action","Drama","Seinen"],"chapters":[{"id":"beb0a5b8-fae4-4c47-899d-8038fc67f6c0","number":"194","title":"Chapter 194","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"5b2ad18f-b1de-4232-adfa-6a71209c7ebd","number":"193","title":"Chapter 193","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"id":"f9d09e61-33b2-4707-aacd-1cdc57bacbb8","number":"192","title":"Chapter 192","date":"2026-07-12","images":[]},{"id":"1f50e89b-14fe-4b97-afd9-5f91b56cf8c5","number":"191","title":"Chapter 191","date":"2026-07-01","images":[]},{"id":"9fee6062-ccff-4c68-97ea-78a90453224d","number":"190","title":"Chapter 190","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"96b0a221-9d23-494f-abe3-52bed0051d42","number":"189","title":"Chapter 189","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"3820ccd2-3acc-4c0a-b8b5-abf943c38deb","number":"188","title":"Chapter 188","date":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"id":"bea2e5b0-9347-4d92-8d94-a89bd77a27e0","number":"187","title":"Chapter 187","date":"2026-06-04","images":[]},{"id":"d44a42b1-ba77-4d7b-96a7-8725dd3d08da","number":"186","title":"Chapter 186","date":"2026-05-30","images":[]},{"id":"b70355c4-5d6f-4b21-b917-3ace78c7f102","number":"185","title":"Chapter 185","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"id":"32d96d08-9b2b-4435-9fb6-b76df1b5d5f9","number":"184","title":"Chapter 184","date":"2026-05-14","images":[]},{"id":"055805cd-7b1d-43